Upstream RSMods
---------------
Rocksmith Audio Bridge runs as external mods inside RSMods
(https://github.com/Lovrom8/RSMods) by Lovrom8 (Lovro), ffio1 and contributors:
its game DLL is upstream RSMods built from the submodule in External/RSMods with
our mods (Mod/) compiled in. RSMods is published without a licence. Its code
remains the property of its authors and is not covered by the MIT License above.

Rocksmith Audio Bridge is maintained separately. Please report problems at
https://github.com/Cheesewizard/RocksmithAudioBridge/issues, not to the RSMods authors.

Third-party components
----------------------
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt lists every third-party component a release ships, which
file it is in, its licence and where the licence text is.

No part of aubio is included. Note by Note's onset detector
(Mod/NoteByNote/Detection/HfcOnsetDetector.hpp) is an independent implementation.
